  "name": "Raw Vegetables",
  "text": "Raw Vegetables\n\nPreparation time:\n\nCooking time:\n\nYield:\n\nIngredients\n\nA selection of vegetables from the following:\n\n‘betel leaves’ (picked),\n\nlong aubergine (sliced),\n\ncucumber (cut into lengths),\n\nspring onions (cut into lengths),\n\niceberg lettuce (cut into wedges),\n\nSiamese watercress (picked),\n\nyoung wing beans or green beans (trimmed),\n\nsnake beans (cut into 2cm lengths),\n\nyoung ginger (peeled and sliced),\n\nwhite turmeric (peeled and sliced),\n\nbanana blossoms (separated into leaves and steeped in acidulated water),\n\nfennel (trimmed and finely sliced),\n\nwitlof (belgian endive) (separated into leaves),\n\nrocket (trimmed),\n\nsorrel leaves (trimmed),\n\nyoung spinach leaves (trimmed),\n\nsavoy cabbage (cut into wedges),\n\ngreen tomatoes (cut into chunks),\n\ngreen mango (peeled and sliced),\n\npomelo (separated into segments),\n\nrose apple (cut into pieces).\n\nPreparation\n\n1. Steep vegetables into very cold water before serving.",
